{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297650","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297650","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1029765001:1":{"text":"嚯嚯嚯，托你们的福，这些日子铁匠们可是忙得团团转！","source_cn":"嚯嚯嚯，托你们的福，这些日子铁匠们可是忙得团团转！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DDA795CA0605FEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029765002:1":{"text":"到处都是商铺和游客，比祭典那会儿都不差多少！","source_cn":"到处都是商铺和游客，比祭典那会儿都不差多少！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10E1E9B5CE60EFB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029765003:1":{"text":"可不是，旅馆的客人也是一拨接着一拨，天天客满啊！","source_cn":"可不是，旅馆的客人也是一拨接着一拨，天天客满啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B6BBA7028370C2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029765004:1":{"text":"只不过我听着客人们聊天，发现里头有不少人都在抱怨，说路上太麻烦了。","source_cn":"只不过我听着客人们聊天，发现里头有不少人都在抱怨，说路...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5860F63E47625F40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1029765004":{"text":"只不过我听着客人们聊天，发现里头有不少人都在抱怨，说路上太麻烦了。","source_cn":"只不过我听着客人们聊天，发现里头有不少人都在抱怨，说路上太麻烦了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5860F63E47625F40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_tit